# ~/.claude repo — allowlist strategy.
# Ignore everything by default so state/cache/secrets Claude Code writes here
# never get committed; then re-include only the portable config worth tracking.
# settings.json itself is generated from settings.base.json plus the overlay
# fragment, so it stays ignored; overlay/ is a separate repository.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/settings.base.json
!/settings-merge.jq
!/settings-merge.sh
!/statusline-command.sh
